WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.970
It was an era when a man lived as a warrior...

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:10.780
He fought, staking his life on
his faith in the sword...

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.610
The final era... the Bakumatsu.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.990
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.850
Tsukikage kooru daichi wo

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.690
Korogari fumiwakete yuku

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:57.900
Horobi to saisei no jidai ga hajimaru

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.570
Jiyuu wo omoku kakagete

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:05.170
Michinaki michi wo erande

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:12.240
Mahiru yori mabushii nichibotsu wo koete

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:19.250
Yume wo kataru you ni toki no fune wa yuku

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:28.350
Sono yamiji no mukou ni atarashii yoake

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:36.270
Bokura wa kitto kurayami no kaina kara umarete kita

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.810
Kanawanu koi wo suruyou ni

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:43.780
Hikari e to samayotteku

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:49.050
Doko made mo hateshino nai kono michi wo

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:54.510
Kaeru sube wa nai

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:27.020
You're the bodyguard British Minister Mr. Parkes
has assigned to Awanokami Katsu-sama,

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:31.960
who's in charge of military affairs in Edo:
Sakyonosuke Kanna-sama...

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.760
You were born in London.

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.630
If I remember correctly, your father
was a Vice Admiral in the British Navy.

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:44.160
And I think your mother was the number one
prostitute of Yoshiwara, a Tayu...

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.600
Jubei Nakaiya...

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:52.640
I'm sure people wouldn't care if a man
who has died before dies once again.

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:54.740
You're right...

00:02:55.650 --> 00:03:04.850
But I'm sure you didn't come just to satisfy a sick
fixation with shooting a dead man, did you?

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:12.330
I'll show you something.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:18.340
There are two sides to everything.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.370
Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe's new play,

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:22.810
"The reverse side of a bribery scandal!

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:26.370
The Hidden Secret of
the Director of Palace Upkeep"!

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:30.980
Today is the last day!

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:34.250
The deep, dark truth will be finally revealed!

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:37.620
It will be finally revealed!

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:41.720
Come one, come all!

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:52.600
Hey, that's for over here. Bring it here.

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:06.520
<i>THE END</i>

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:10.420
Akizuki-sama.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:14.860
I know that we've got you involved
in our personal revenge drama.

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:18.230
You might think it's too late now,
but I still want to say something to you.

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:21.860
Don't worry about it.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:28.300
The script is finished. His name is in there.

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:31.110
Leader!

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:36.110
Everyone, let's start the final rehearsal,
from the start to the end!

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:36.980
All right.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:37.710
Okay.
All right.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.340
The cursed spirit of darkness,

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:06.310
which has brought chaos and disaster
to this land for the last 2000 years...

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:09.710
It begins to stir again.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:16.480
What do you say? Do you want to enjoy
this together with me, Kanna-sama?

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:22.320
Do you want to see it bring chaos and
disaster, and make people suffer?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.660
I only wish for an opportunity to meet that man.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.600
Well, that's what you said...

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:39.770
Jofuku and three thousand young men and
women were sent to this land long ago

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.350
by Emperor Shi Huangdi to seal the Head.

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:50.580
Supposedly the most skilled of their number
was granted a blade called the Moontear Sword,

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:55.820
and the one who wields it is called
The Eternal Assassin...

00:05:57.030 --> 00:06:04.370
That's right. The Eternal Assassin
is indeed that man, Yojiro Akizuki.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:14.280
This revenge drama they're performing...

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:17.680
The writer's true objective is
the Head of the Conqueror.

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:20.310
I can say the same about you.

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:25.250
Sealing the Head...
That's my objective, nothing else.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:29.220
I need it for the sake of Japan.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:32.160
That is not what it's for.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:34.820
As far as you know, that is.

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:36.530
I won't let anyone get it!

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:39.800
I'll seal it with my own hands. That's all!

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:42.440
So that's your mission, correct?

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:45.770
As the Eternal Assassin...

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.300
They look good.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.390
Let's make tempura with them.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:10.970
Have you heard from Yojiro since then?

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:12.500
No, I haven't.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:15.770
Actually, what's bothering me is the fact
that the star is once again...

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:18.010
This one is nice, too.

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:19.370
Then let's put that in the miso soup.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:45.470
Tatsugoro Shinmon

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.570
Tatsugoro Shimon.

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:48.000
Because he's the head of Edo's
famous fire fighting brigade Ogumi

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:51.130
and because his daughter is the
concubine of Shogun Yoshinobu,

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.970
he has a close relationship with Katsu.

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:59.820
They have been secretly plotting
a very bold plan

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:03.910
to stop the Eastern Army from
entering Edo. However...

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:06.160
Watch the play?

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:08.790
This play is something else.

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:12.400
You came all the way to Yokohama.
Why don't you watch it with me?

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:16.170
Yeah, I've heard about it, too.

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:20.040
I think it's about the incident from ten years ago
involving the Director of Palace Upkeep...

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:21.770
That's exactly it.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:28.350
"There are two sides to everything."

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:29.840
That's it!

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:40.360
Now that I think about it, maybe all this mess
was already starting back then...

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:46.690
Ten years had passed since the Ansei Purge,

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:50.670
in which the government clamped down
and cleaned out the anti-Imperial faction,

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:53.360
which mainly consisted of the
Hitotsubashi and Mito Provinces.

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:57.500
Eight years had passed since the assassination
of the Director of Palace Upkeep, Naosuke li,

00:08:57.610 --> 00:08:58.670
who was an advocate of the faction.

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:02.440
Japan was literally in upheaval.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:13.990
But I guess there would be no future for this
country unless you overcome a mess like this.

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:20.360
Oh, now where's the one with the pistol, Master?

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.230
You mean, my bodyguard?

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:24.700
I don't know why, but he's been gone a while.

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:27.270
Is everything okay?

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:30.840
With all these big guns with me
I have nothing to worry about.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.150
How's the preparation going?

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:41.850
We're all set.

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:42.850
It's tonight!

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:47.020
Just as planned, we're going to inflict
divine retribution on the British consul tonight!

00:09:57.770 --> 00:10:01.360
So now the deal is done.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:13.050
Depending on how things go tonight, you might
have to go on stage yourself, Kanna-sama.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:22.520
It's pleased! It's excited!

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:40.310
Leader, it's time.

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:41.980
Okay.

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:52.350
Kill, kill, kill, kill, kill...

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:02.490
Excuse me from the stage,

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:10.840
but there's something I'd like to say as it is
the final day for our performance today.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:13.010
Thanks to you, our new play

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:18.780
"The reverse side of a bribery scandal - The
Hidden Secret of the Director of Palace Upkeep"

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:25.310
has been sold out every day, and we'd like to
thank you for the bottom of our hearts.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:37.290
We hope every one of you enjoy every moment
of the show from the beginning to the end!

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:43.400
We thank you very much!

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.500
Kakunojo!

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:04.700
There are two sides to everything.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:09.860
Politics are no different.
Do you understand that?

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:11.240
Of course I do!

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:16.140
If there's any traitor you wish to dispose of,

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:19.670
I can certainly take care of that for you
since you can't do so publicly.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:23.500
We have skilled men to do the job!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:30.840
We are those who become Akki Rasetsu, in order
to slay all who threaten the peace of the land!

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:34.160
Good job.

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:35.180
Thanks.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:36.430
Good job.

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:37.160
Thanks.

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:37.720
Good job.

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:04.620
S-someone help me!

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:14.590
It's awfully quiet.

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:46.290
Come get us, Tengu scoundrels!

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.470
"Come out, Tengu scoundrels!"

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:50.930
We know you're in there!

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:54.100
What do we do?

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.930
Cease your resistance!

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:58.010
"Stop resisting!"

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:00.610
Let's fight!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.480
B-but!

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:05.350
We're not going to die
showing our backs to the enemy!

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:06.840
You're right!

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:10.710
We'll show them the samurai way of dying!
We'll show them our manly spirit!

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:11.920
Yeah!

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:17.780
Is everything okay?

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:22.260
It's nothing. I guess the curtain will be
closing soon on the other stage.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:26.170
Ready!

00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:27.530
Fire!

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:39.210
If you were a warrior, I would give you
the mercy of committing seppuku,

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:43.310
but you're nothing but a merchant
who cares only about money.

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:45.710
If you must hate, if you must despise,

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:52.960
then hate yourself, despise yourself for daring to
oppose the Director of Palace Upkeep!

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.500
Impressive!

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:05.580
Thank you, sir.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.680
I'll give you a reward. What do you desire?

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:14.050
I don't deserve it. All I did was
get rid of a shipping agent.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.150
Do not hesitate to ask.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:19.520
Even the strongest mountain could crumble
because of a single hole.

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:23.890
Eliminating something from inside is harder than
eliminating something on the surface.

00:15:23.890 --> 00:15:25.890
Well then, if I may...

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:30.300
I want you to kill me!

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:31.270
What?

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:33.100
Don't worry!

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:35.540
Even if I die or get killed once or twice,

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:42.100
I will resurrect from the pit of Hell and
stir up things in the world again and again!

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:47.510
I see. You're going to pretend that you're dead
so you can just sit back and watch!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:50.310
You're truly an evil man...

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:55.050
Nakaiya! Jubei Nakaiya!

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:01.100
I see... That's what happened, huh?

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.760
That's as far as you go!

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:07.100
Jubei Nakaiya! My true enemy!

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.140
I've finally caught you!

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:15.450
I'm ready to show you! I'm ready to act out the
Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe's revenge!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.350
Kakunojo!
The best in Japan!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:23.450
You mere actors make me laugh!
Kill me if you think you can!

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.000
Ready!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:38.830
Fire!

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:57.020
Let's go!

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:57.780
Yeah!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.190
Kill, kill, kill...

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:36.990
Damn it!

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:39.350
Ready!

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:41.290
Fire!

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:12.230
Ready!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:13.460
Fire!

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:26.510
Kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill...

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:54.490
Th-that was awesome...

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:18.030
Hey, wait!

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:27.470
Shoot... We had things we wanted to ask them...

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:31.000
If I remember correctly,
that man was Katsu-sensei's...

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:54.060
Angry? Frightened? No, it's pleased!

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:58.730
Does it mean that new chaos is about to unfold?

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:05.000
Attention!

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:13.780
Ready, front!

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:27.990
Are you still going to do it, Master?

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:29.900
Are they ready?

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:32.440
Of course, they're all set.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:35.300
They can cover all of Edo in flames
in an hour if they want to.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:40.210
I don't care if you're Saigo or whoever,
no one can enter Edo then.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:44.210
You know, setting something on fire
is much easier than putting it out.

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:48.380
But the problem is figuring out how to
evacuate the entire city of Edo.

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:53.060
I can contact all the gamblers in Edo
as a member of the Ogumi...

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:55.320
No, let's not do it.

00:20:55.660 --> 00:21:01.470
Even Edo is famous for fights and fires,
I don't think I want it to look like this.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:02.930
Besides...

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:10.760
If we had to rely on them, even just once,
this country will be...

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:20.950
"Do not turn Edo into a battlefield."

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:22.580
Carrying this message from Katsu,

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:28.260
Tesshu Yamaoka and Kyunosuke Masumitsu
went around the fissure left by the earthquake

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:31.490
and headed to the armed camp
of the Eastern Army, however...

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:34.360
It was already too late.

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:45.870
<i>PRINCE</i>
<i>TARUHITO ARISUGAWANOMIYA</i>

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:53.140
It is the third month of the
fourth year of the Keio Era.

00:21:53.280 --> 00:21:58.120
Spring comes in name only as the
country falls even deeper into chaos.

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>THE CLOSING</i>
<i>PERFORMANCE BURNS</i>

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:09.330
Sono te wa ai no tsurugi

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.400
Subete no hajimari no akashi

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Hikaru sora no hate

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
Yume wa mada maboroshi

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Tsuki no akari kage ouyouni hashiru kono michi

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Tsuki no akari kage ouyouni hashiru kono michi

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
Chigireta ai no tsurugi

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
Sashidasu saki wa ikusen no namida ga hitotsu ni nari

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
Ashita wo kagayakaseru

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
Kono te wa ai no tsurugi

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
Subete no hajimari no akashi

00:23:33.050 --> 00:23:48.300
EPISODE 7
SOTETSU MOVES

00:23:33.420 --> 00:23:37.750
Though amateurish and clumsy, I practiced
day in and day out, hiding from the sun.

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:41.460
But I still failed to find any clue of the enemy,
and now I'm physically and mentally drained.

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:42.460
But right then...

00:23:42.460 --> 00:23:45.160
There's this customer who's been
coming here every day.

00:23:45.160 --> 00:23:50.330
I knew he knew something, but who would've
thought he knew everything from back then?

00:23:48.300 --> 00:24:02.570
SOTETSU MOVES

00:23:50.330 --> 00:23:54.810
Master... No, I mean Sotetsu Ibaraki...
He's no ordinary man.

00:23:54.810 --> 00:23:56.610
What is his true identity?

00:23:56.610 --> 00:24:00.310
He could be the master thief
who seeks the power!

00:24:00.310 --> 00:24:01.810
Who knows?
